  [*] --&gt; Ready
  Ready --&gt; Ready: valid drain or recharge
  Ready --&gt; Ready: invalid request rejected
  Ready --&gt; Empty: drain remaining charge
  Empty --&gt; Ready: recharge
  Ready --&gt; Full: recharge to capacity
  Full --&gt; Ready: drain








