20



if temperature &lt; 10:
    label = "cold"
elif temperature &lt; 20:
    label = "mild"
else:
    label = "warm"
Test one value just below, exactly at, and just above every threshold: 9, 10, 11, 19, 20, and 21. Typical middle values do not prove endpoint behavior.

